#: data/maps/LilycoveCity_DepartmentStore_5F/scripts.inc:145
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_DepartmentStore_5F_Text_PlaceFullOfCuteDolls"
msgid ""
"This place is full of cute DOLLS.\p"
"I should buy some for me, instead of\n"
"just for my children.$"
msgstr ""
"这里到处都是可爱的玩偶。\p"
"我不该光给孩子们买，\n"
"也该给自己买几个。$"

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity_DepartmentStore_5F/scripts.inc:150
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_DepartmentStore_5F_Text_GettingDollInsteadOfPokemon"
msgid ""
"I'm not big enough to raise POKéMON,\n"
"so I'm getting a cute DOLL instead.$"
msgstr ""
"我还太小，不能培养宝可梦，\n"
"所以就买个可爱的玩偶代替。$"

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity_DepartmentStore_5F/scripts.inc:154
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_DepartmentStore_5F_Text_SellManyCuteMatsHere"
msgid ""
"They sell many cute MATS here.\p"
"I wonder which one I should get?\n"
"Maybe I'll buy them all…$"
msgstr ""
"这里卖好多可爱的垫子。\p"
"我该买哪一个呢？\n"
"干脆全买了吧……$"

#: data/maps/LilycoveCity_DepartmentStore_5F/scripts.inc:159
msgctxt "LilycoveCity_DepartmentStore_5F_Text_ClosedRooftopForWeather"
msgid ""
"I think they closed the rooftop\n"
"because the weather is wild today.$"
msgstr ""
"今天天气太恶劣了，\n"
"所以屋顶好像关闭了。$"
